 },
 "noMusic": true,
 "noMusicReason": "VO-only variant of the approved reel. On 2026-08-18 the user asked for the music bed to be dropped from airpods-camera while keeping the SFX; that was logged as a per-video call, so the canonical iphone-18-pro keeps its automated bed and this derivative ships alongside it. Scenes, captions, SFX and the approved narration are identical."
